  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the availability of the people in a conversation during a status activity.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Availability gives a hint about how likely a timely reply is. <see cref="F:Android.App.People.ConversationAvailability.Unknown" /> means that availability is not known; it does not mean that the person is offline.</para>
      <para>These values correspond to the <c>AVAILABILITY_</c> constants in the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/1a5cb387d6542391d0edf69cdd828e5b7c8a9d65/core/java/android/app/people/ConversationStatus.java">Android status definition</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
